  "prefLabel": "Ban 103.03 Trust Division",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ban 103.03 Trust Division. The trust division, headed by the director of trusts, shall conduct:\n\n(a) Examinations of each state-chartered trust company and family trust company;\n\n(b) Reviews of applications, notices, and other requests for business activity related to public and family trust companies; and\n\n(c) Other regulatory functions required to supervise chartered trust companies and family trust companies.\n\nSource. #6146, eff 12-22-95; ss by #10258, eff 1-24-13; ss by #14096, eff 10-3-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ban100.html"
